pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  # —— 页面标题 ——
  - elementId: pg-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 36, 500, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: '图标（官方 iconName: "style:name" 格式）'
  - elementId: pg-sub
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 84, 800, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: "Font Awesome Free 7：fas: 实心 / far: 描边 / fab: 品牌（CC BY 4.0，SVG 嵌入导出）"
  # —— fas: 实心（主题色） ——
  - elementId: ic-1
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [48, 140, 56, 56]
    iconName: "fas:lightbulb"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: ic-2
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [130, 140, 56, 56]
    iconName: "fas:chart-line"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#059669"}
  - elementId: ic-3
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [212, 140, 56, 56]
    iconName: "fas:users"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#F59E0B"}
  - elementId: ic-4
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [294, 140, 56, 56]
    iconName: "fas:gear"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#7C3AED"}
  - elementId: ic-5
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [376, 140, 56, 56]
    iconName: "fas:circle-check"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#DC2626"}
  # —— 渐变填充图标 ——
  - elementId: ic-6
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [470, 130, 80, 80]
    iconName: "fas:rocket"
    fill:
      type: gradient
      gradientType: linear
      angle: 45
      stops:
        - {position: 0, color: "$primary"}
        - {position: 1, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: ic-7
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [580, 130, 80, 80]
    iconName: "fas:star"
    fill:
      type: gradient
      gradientType: radial
      stops:
        - {position: 0, color: "#FDE68A"}
        - {position: 1, color: "#F59E0B"}
  # —— fas:/far: 混排 ——
  - elementId: ic-8
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [700, 140, 56, 56]
    iconName: "fas:house"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: ic-9
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [782, 140, 56, 56]
    iconName: "fas:bolt"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#F59E0B"}
  - elementId: ic-10
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [864, 140, 56, 56]
    iconName: "far:heart"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#DC2626"}
  # —— 图标 + 文字混排说明 ——
  - elementId: ic-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 260, 864, 240]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>第一行：<strong>fas:</strong> 实心风格（最常用），far: 描边风格（免费子集）</p>
        <p>第二行：渐变填充（linear / radial，官方 Fill 类型）</p>
        <p>第三行：<strong>fab:</strong> 品牌图标（免费库原生支持，约 570 个）</p>
        <p>未知图标（如 fas:non-existent）预览显示占位框，导出自动跳过并告警</p>
        <p>导出为 PowerPoint 原生图标格式（SVG 图片，可改色 / 转换为形状）</p>
